From b953a346a9835c79c466d3344f5ad31452b524cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 08:43:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Backend part 2b: report fields category, people, can_move

category (required, 1-40), people (1-999) and can_move (yes/no/unsure) for
help requests only, contact required for help requests. Responders see all
three; the public hazard output gets category only; my reports shows the
sender's category. Existing databases get the new columns on start.
